"a": "<div class=\"formula\">FV = PV x (1 + i)<sup>n</sup> = 60,000 x (1.09)<sup>4</sup> = 60,000 x 1.4116 = <b>₹84,696</b></div><p>Interest earned = 24,696.</p>",
