"a": "<div class=\"formula\">DFL = EBIT / EBT = 8,00,000 / (8,00,000 - 2,00,000) = 8,00,000 / 6,00,000 = <b>1.33</b></div><p>A 1% change in EBIT changes EPS by 1.33%.</p>",
