"t": "Cost of preference",
"p": 3,
"q": "A company issues 12% irredeemable preference shares of ₹100 at ₹95 per share; flotation expenses ₹3 per share. Calculate the cost of preference share capital.",
"a": "<p>Dividend = 12% x 100 = ₹12; net proceeds = 95 - 3 = ₹92.</p><div class=\"formula\">K<sub>p</sub> = PD / NP = 12 / 92 x 100 = <b>13.04%</b></div><p>No tax adjustment - preference dividend is not tax-deductible.</p>",
