"u": "Unit III",
"t": "Cost of equity",
"p": 3,
"q": "Equity shares quoted at ₹160. Expected dividend next year ₹12 per share; constant growth 6%. Calculate the cost of equity using the Dividend Growth Model.",
"a": "<div class=\"formula\">K<sub>e</sub> = D<sub>1</sub> / P<sub>0</sub> + g = 12 / 160 + 6% = 7.5% + 6% = <b>13.5%</b></div>",
