"u": "Unit III",
"t": "CAPM",
"p": 3,
"q": "Risk-free rate 6%, expected market return 14%, equity beta 1.25. Calculate the cost of equity using CAPM.",
"a": "<div class=\"formula\">K<sub>e</sub> = R<sub>f</sub> + &beta; (R<sub>m</sub> - R<sub>f</sub>) = 6 + 1.25 x (14 - 6) = 6 + 10 = <b>16%</b></div><p>The market risk premium is 8%; beta 1.25 means the share is 25% more volatile than the market.</p>",
"ms": "",
