"q": "ABC Ltd.: debt ₹5,00,000, preference ₹2,00,000, equity ₹3,00,000. Before-tax cost of debt 10%, tax 30%, cost of preference 12%, cost of equity 16%. Calculate WACC using the given amounts as weights.",
"a": "<p>After-tax cost of debt = 10% x (1 - 0.30) = 7%.</p><table><tr><th>Source</th><th>Amount (₹)</th><th>Weight</th><th>Cost (%)</th><th>Weight x cost</th></tr><tr><td>Debt</td><td>5,00,000</td><td>0.50</td><td>7</td><td>3.50</td></tr><tr><td>Preference</td><td>2,00,000</td><td>0.20</td><td>12</td><td>2.40</td></tr><tr><td>Equity</td><td>3,00,000</td><td>0.30</td><td>16</td><td>4.80</td></tr><tr><td><b>WACC</b></td><td>10,00,000</td><td>1.00</td><td></td><td><b>10.70%</b></td></tr></table><div class=\"formula\">WACC = <b>10.70%</b></div>",
