"q": "A company has debt ₹4,00,000, preference ₹1,00,000, equity ₹5,00,000. After-tax cost of debt 7%, preference 11%, equity 15%. Calculate WACC using the given amounts as weights.",
"a": "<table><tr><th>Source</th><th>Amount (₹)</th><th>Weight</th><th>Cost (%)</th><th>Weight x cost</th></tr><tr><td>Debt</td><td>4,00,000</td><td>0.40</td><td>7</td><td>2.80</td></tr><tr><td>Preference</td><td>1,00,000</td><td>0.10</td><td>11</td><td>1.10</td></tr><tr><td>Equity</td><td>5,00,000</td><td>0.50</td><td>15</td><td>7.50</td></tr><tr><td><b>WACC</b></td><td>10,00,000</td><td>1.00</td><td></td><td><b>11.40%</b></td></tr></table><div class=\"formula\">WACC = <b>11.40%</b></div>",
